{"v":1,"title":"حجز موعد الرقية الشرعية — أليسوم","slug":"ruqya-booking","desc":"احجز موعد الرقية الشرعية ليوم السبت: جلسة فردية أو زوج وزوجة أو أبناء أو عائلة، مع عرض السعر قبل التأكيد.","bg":"transparent","ff":"Cairo","header":true,"footer":true,"css":"body.pb-page{background:linear-gradient(180deg,#f7fbf3,#fff 40%,#f4f9f1);color:#16324c;font-family:'Cairo',sans-serif;overflow-x:hidden}\n","sections":[{"id":"tpxoeq2","set":{"layout":"boxed","cw":{"d":1180},"pad":{"d":[60,0,14,0],"m":[36,0,10,0]},"gap":{"d":24},"va":{"d":"center"},"cls":"","cid":"top"},"cols":[{"id":"l9swq7d","set":{"w":{"d":100,"m":100}},"widgets":[{"id":"4nc5vrg","type":"heading","set":{"text":"حجز موعد الرقية الشرعية","tag":"h1","fs":{"d":42,"m":28},"fw":"900","ta":{"d":"center"},"color":"#123e72","lh":{"d":1.3}}},{"id":"7qpnezs","type":"text","set":{"html":"<p>احجز موعدك ليوم السبت، اختر نوع الجلسة وسيظهر لك السعر مباشرة قبل التأكيد.</p>","fs":{"d":17,"m":15},"lh":{"d":1.9},"ta":{"d":"center"},"color":"#5d6f66","fw":"600"}}]}]},{"id":"col6gn6","set":{"layout":"boxed","cw":{"d":800},"pad":{"d":[6,0,60,0],"m":[4,14,40,14]},"gap":{"d":24},"va":{"d":"center"},"cls":"","cid":"booking"},"cols":[{"id":"vua7s0l","set":{"w":{"d":100,"m":100}},"widgets":[{"id":"ltvo5y5","type":"html","set":{"code":"<style>\n.rq{max-width:760px;margin:0 auto;font-family:'Cairo',sans-serif;color:#16324c;direction:rtl;line-height:1.7;box-sizing:border-box}\n.rq *{box-sizing:border-box}\n.rq-card{background:#fff;border:2px solid #d9e8dc;border-radius:22px;padding:20px 18px;margin:0 0 16px;box-shadow:0 10px 28px #123e7214}\n.rq h3{margin:0 0 12px;font-size:19px;font-weight:900;color:#123e72;display:flex;align-items:center;gap:10px}\n.rq h3 b{display:inline-flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;width:30px;height:30px;border-radius:50%;background:#187a3b;color:#fff;font-size:15px;flex:none}\n.rq-info{background:#f1f8f2;border:1px solid #cfe5d3;border-radius:16px;padding:12px 16px;font-size:14px;font-weight:700;color:#1